# `permissions.get`

Permission preset at the requested scope — id, scope, and JSON body.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.permissions.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`GetPermissionResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |
| `preset_json` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call permissions.get --json '{ "id": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "allow-bash-read",
  "scope": "project",
  "preset_json": "{\"default_mode\":\"ship-standard\",\"rules\":[{\"type\":\"allow\",\"tools\":[\"Bash(git *)\",\"Read\",\"Write\",\"Edit\"]}]}"
}
```
